[{"start":12737.702,"end":12739.142,"text":"Okay. Sorry. Piotr."},{"start":12740.842,"end":12740.942,"text":"Yep."},{"start":12741.262,"end":12743.542,"text":"To talk about Poland. Moving countries."},{"start":12745.002,"end":12745.702,"text":"Hello, everyone."},{"start":12747.802,"end":12750.662,"text":"I'm Piotr Piekarski. I'm a node manager and"},{"start":12751.242,"end":12752.742,"text":"head of delegation."},{"start":12753.722,"end":12755.362,"text":"I play both these roles, and"},{"start":12757.962,"end":12760.482,"text":"as an entomologist, I was"},{"start":12761.382,"end":12764.442,"text":"always very aware of the"},{"start":12765.362,"end":12767.982,"text":"complexities and intricacies of taxonomy."},{"start":12769.062,"end":12769.282,"text":"And"},{"start":12770.462,"end":12772.202,"text":"I'm going to show you"},{"start":12773.662,"end":12777.522,"text":"our new tool, new device, new database system"},{"start":12778.102,"end":12781.482,"text":"allowing us to control our national checklists."},{"start":12783.122,"end":12783.382,"text":"And"},{"start":12785.542,"end":12786.162,"text":"for many years,"},{"start":12787.462,"end":12791.222,"text":"I was complaining how badly organized is"},{"start":12791.542,"end":12795.402,"text":"the information available about species in our country."},{"start":12797.562,"end":12800.282,"text":"And thanks to the recent"},{"start":12800.982,"end":12802.222,"text":"projects and"},{"start":12803.542,"end":12807.462,"text":"subsidies from the government, our successes in"},{"start":12808.802,"end":12810.282,"text":"obtaining them, we"},{"start":12811.222,"end":12815.082,"text":"were able to develop our skills and our capacities in"},{"start":12815.122,"end":12815.802,"text":"this respect."},{"start":12817.302,"end":12820.402,"text":"So this is the part of the Polish GBIF's node"},{"start":12820.462,"end":12821.402,"text":"implementation."},{"start":12822.622,"end":12823.222,"text":"The project"},{"start":12824.102,"end":12827.322,"text":"was set, this is information which is missing, was"},{"start":12828.082,"end":12832.042,"text":"launched actually in 2021, but only now we"},{"start":12832.162,"end":12835.922,"text":"are achieve the zero level to allowing"},{"start":12836.162,"end":12836.702,"text":"users to"},{"start":12837.982,"end":12840.122,"text":"edit the checklists online."},{"start":12842.174,"end":12842.934,"text":"The project was"},{"start":12843.854,"end":12845.434,"text":"based on the work of more than"},{"start":12846.294,"end":12847.254,"text":"120"},{"start":12848.114,"end":12851.714,"text":"cooperators, specialists from more than 20 institutions."},{"start":12853.334,"end":12857.274,"text":"Everything was done, conducted under the umbrella"},{"start":12857.354,"end":12860.014,"text":"of the Polish Biodiversity Information Network, SIBP."},{"start":12861.254,"end":12863.394,"text":"The address you have on the QR code."},{"start":12865.654,"end":12865.894,"text":"And"},{"start":12866.834,"end":12870.394,"text":"all the checklists were published as checklist dataset through GBIF."},{"start":12872.814,"end":12876.594,"text":"Well, they are automatically synchronized with Checklist"},{"start":12876.674,"end":12880.374,"text":"Bank, of course, but we want to develop"},{"start":12880.454,"end":12882.494,"text":"the organization of"},{"start":12883.774,"end":12887.054,"text":"what is available in Checklist Bank using their"},{"start":12888.774,"end":12889.694,"text":"management system."},{"start":12891.294,"end":12893.234,"text":"And we hope to be"},{"start":12894.174,"end":12897.114,"text":"mapped by the governmental institutions and"},{"start":12897.674,"end":12900.354,"text":"agencies in the future."},{"start":12902.794,"end":12903.094,"text":"The"},{"start":12904.594,"end":12905.634,"text":"scope of the"},{"start":12906.614,"end":12910.254,"text":"database covers all eukaryotic and cyanobacteria species"},{"start":12910.294,"end":12913.454,"text":"recorded for Poland. It turned out it's more than"},{"start":12914.194,"end":12915.274,"text":"expected. It's more than"},{"start":12916.914,"end":12918.354,"text":"65,000 species."},{"start":12919.594,"end":12922.934,"text":"All checklists were divided into 107 chapters."},{"start":12924.094,"end":12926.034,"text":"The authors are supervising"},{"start":12927.034,"end":12929.214,"text":"the composition of the checklists."},{"start":12930.014,"end":12932.934,"text":"Every species is documented by at least one"},{"start":12933.834,"end":12935.474,"text":"bibliographical reference,"},{"start":12936.554,"end":12939.774,"text":"so we also keep a bibliography here."},{"start":12942.694,"end":12946.634,"text":"Every species has assigned status, whether it is present or"},{"start":12946.694,"end":12947.154,"text":"not, or"},{"start":12948.474,"end":12950.494,"text":"it demands confirmation,"},{"start":12951.554,"end":12953.334,"text":"so it has a question mark then."},{"start":12954.634,"end":12958.534,"text":"Keywords and attributes are also comprised"},{"start":12958.594,"end":12960.614,"text":"in the database, so"},{"start":12961.814,"end":12965.794,"text":"species are connected with some kind of system of keywords and"},{"start":12966.094,"end":12967.934,"text":"keys and values associated."},{"start":12970.014,"end":12973.454,"text":"The reference can be a publication of an expert"},{"start":12973.514,"end":12974.014,"text":"opinion,"},{"start":12974.914,"end":12978.754,"text":"and the taxonomy tables were based on the ITIS data model,"},{"start":12979.954,"end":12981.894,"text":"published recently, some years ago."},{"start":12982.934,"end":12983.314,"text":"And the"},{"start":12984.214,"end":12986.494,"text":"authors control the list"},{"start":12987.534,"end":12989.334,"text":"and the way they are presented."},{"start":12991.674,"end":12995.474,"text":"The digital catalog of"},{"start":12995.514,"end":12997.894,"text":"biodiversity of Poland is maintained on"},{"start":13000.014,"end":13001.094,"text":"our data portal,"},{"start":13002.354,"end":13004.534,"text":"our own solution for management of"},{"start":13007.774,"end":13008.514,"text":"the database."},{"start":13010.234,"end":13010.534,"text":"And"},{"start":13011.854,"end":13015.834,"text":"this is also managed by the authors through the tools"},{"start":13015.894,"end":13017.314,"text":"dedicated for users to"},{"start":13018.294,"end":13020.974,"text":"give them possibility to control the"},{"start":13023.454,"end":13025.854,"text":"taxonomy itself and the composition of"},{"start":13027.394,"end":13031.254,"text":"the checklist, and of course, it's regulated by the system of roles and"},{"start":13031.314,"end":13031.914,"text":"permissions."},{"start":13033.894,"end":13034.094,"text":"So"},{"start":13035.914,"end":13037.174,"text":"only some people can"},{"start":13038.054,"end":13041.894,"text":"have the privileges to do the job."},{"start":13042.514,"end":13045.374,"text":"I'm going to show you a number of slides"},{"start":13046.254,"end":13048.534,"text":"just to illustrate how it works. So"},{"start":13049.514,"end":13051.054,"text":"here we see the main"},{"start":13055.974,"end":13056.974,"text":"view of the portal."},{"start":13058.354,"end":13062.274,"text":"It's divided into a number of so-called perspectives, and the last"},{"start":13062.314,"end":13066.254,"text":"perspective is about checklists, so here is the list of checklists available,"},{"start":13067.094,"end":13069.794,"text":"covering the biodiversity of the country."},{"start":13070.414,"end":13074.214,"text":"And each record here is"},{"start":13074.494,"end":13077.574,"text":"published in GBIF, and this represents"},{"start":13078.274,"end":13078.814,"text":"individual"},{"start":13080.014,"end":13083.474,"text":"checklist chapters. So here we have some"},{"start":13083.994,"end":13085.954,"text":"springtails and proturans"},{"start":13087.574,"end":13091.534,"text":"showed, and the right panel shows you the structure of"},{"start":13091.574,"end":13094.534,"text":"the checklist. So it's quite simple, straightforward."},{"start":13094.574,"end":13094.854,"text":"You can"},{"start":13095.714,"end":13096.594,"text":"extend the list."},{"start":13098.393,"end":13099.734,"text":"You can download it"},{"start":13102.133,"end":13104.174,"text":"as a Excel sheet."},{"start":13106.214,"end":13106.554,"text":"So"},{"start":13108.454,"end":13109.354,"text":"you can also"},{"start":13110.314,"end":13112.114,"text":"show the details and the"},{"start":13113.734,"end":13116.194,"text":"publications connected with each record,"},{"start":13117.014,"end":13117.974,"text":"like showing"},{"start":13119.054,"end":13119.194,"text":"a"},{"start":13120.814,"end":13123.234,"text":"proof that the"},{"start":13123.334,"end":13126.034,"text":"species is present in Poland."},{"start":13126.954,"end":13127.214,"text":"And the"},{"start":13128.714,"end":13129.374,"text":"references"},{"start":13130.214,"end":13133.714,"text":"are included in our database, so you can use the"},{"start":13134.054,"end":13137.354,"text":"details instead of seeing the"},{"start":13138.074,"end":13139.774,"text":"simple abbreviated"},{"start":13140.654,"end":13141.534,"text":"references. You can"},{"start":13142.794,"end":13145.334,"text":"extend them, and you can see the details of them"},{"start":13146.354,"end":13147.074,"text":"also. So"},{"start":13147.914,"end":13151.794,"text":"this is the way each chapter is presented in GBIF"},{"start":13151.834,"end":13155.714,"text":"website. Here is the same on the Checklist Bank"},{"start":13155.894,"end":13156.414,"text":"portal."},{"start":13157.654,"end":13161.314,"text":"And we have an additional way to present the"},{"start":13161.394,"end":13165.094,"text":"whole, so this is like a summary of all"},{"start":13166.494,"end":13170.434,"text":"taxa, with numbers representing the number of species"},{"start":13170.474,"end":13172.634,"text":"recorded for Poland for this particular"},{"start":13173.834,"end":13175.214,"text":"taxon group, and of course, it's"},{"start":13176.194,"end":13178.174,"text":"maintained in the taxonomical database."},{"start":13179.134,"end":13182.574,"text":"So we have also the additional graphical panel to show"},{"start":13182.654,"end":13185.914,"text":"it in more comprehensive and attractive"},{"start":13186.754,"end":13189.474,"text":"way. So here is the whole, with the"},{"start":13190.394,"end":13191.594,"text":"tooltips showing the"},{"start":13192.634,"end":13194.034,"text":"numbers for each particular"},{"start":13195.614,"end":13199.534,"text":"part. And it is interacting with the left side."},{"start":13199.614,"end":13202.194,"text":"So if you click here, the right"},{"start":13203.674,"end":13205.274,"text":"panel will change, and"},{"start":13206.354,"end":13207.074,"text":"actually you can"},{"start":13207.894,"end":13209.274,"text":"filter it also here."},{"start":13211.074,"end":13214.614,"text":"You can also control the way you show the structure of"},{"start":13215.014,"end":13216.954,"text":"the list. So you can look at"},{"start":13218.054,"end":13220.754,"text":"different levels depending on the user's needs."},{"start":13221.754,"end":13221.974,"text":"Now"},{"start":13222.954,"end":13223.174,"text":"all"},{"start":13224.094,"end":13227.874,"text":"levels are checked, so it is very detailed."},{"start":13229.334,"end":13233.094,"text":"And also you can control to some extent the"},{"start":13233.974,"end":13236.354,"text":"depth of the graph on the right side."},{"start":13236.434,"end":13240.214,"text":"So here it's a"},{"start":13240.254,"end":13244.094,"text":"medium. Here is more wide solution, so it"},{"start":13247.294,"end":13250.854,"text":"may seem to be not very complete because some of"},{"start":13250.914,"end":13253.614,"text":"the levels are not"},{"start":13253.674,"end":13255.354,"text":"represented for"},{"start":13256.794,"end":13257.694,"text":"all the groups."},{"start":13259.554,"end":13263.214,"text":"And here is the narrow"},{"start":13264.774,"end":13266.234,"text":"view. So it is"},{"start":13268.294,"end":13269.934,"text":"less complicated, less"},{"start":13270.874,"end":13271.414,"text":"levels are"},{"start":13272.494,"end":13272.814,"text":"shown."},{"start":13278.394,"end":13278.554,"text":"And a"},{"start":13280.994,"end":13284.914,"text":"click was done here, so the list is filtered on the left side."},{"start":13286.154,"end":13286.534,"text":"And"},{"start":13288.694,"end":13290.114,"text":"here is again the"},{"start":13291.074,"end":13291.494,"text":"wider"},{"start":13292.454,"end":13294.754,"text":"view chosen."},{"start":13296.434,"end":13296.814,"text":"And"},{"start":13304.594,"end":13307.594,"text":"here you can see the details of the checklist"},{"start":13308.614,"end":13309.494,"text":"on the right side. So"},{"start":13310.514,"end":13314.114,"text":"then it filters all hexapods, and all hexapods"},{"start":13315.654,"end":13317.774,"text":"filter is used on the right side."},{"start":13318.834,"end":13322.654,"text":"Sorry. You can"},{"start":13322.734,"end":13325.634,"text":"also click the details of the taxon and"},{"start":13327.234,"end":13328.614,"text":"go to the first"},{"start":13329.534,"end":13333.514,"text":"perspective, first view, first panel showing the taxonomy tree."},{"start":13334.194,"end":13338.154,"text":"And if you choose"},{"start":13338.213,"end":13342.174,"text":"the gallery and pictures, then it"},{"start":13342.214,"end":13344.414,"text":"will be possible to filter it and"},{"start":13346.254,"end":13347.594,"text":"select the level"},{"start":13348.534,"end":13352.234,"text":"of the taxonomical groups"},{"start":13352.314,"end":13353.214,"text":"you choose and"},{"start":13354.134,"end":13357.794,"text":"use it as a browser to browse through different"},{"start":13357.854,"end":13358.554,"text":"groups of"},{"start":13359.854,"end":13360.334,"text":"taxa."},{"start":13363.394,"end":13364.814,"text":"Users can edit it,"},{"start":13368.734,"end":13372.554,"text":"play with taxonomy, play with the structure of the checklist."},{"start":13373.694,"end":13377.434,"text":"And we plan to extend the checklist with"},{"start":13379.034,"end":13380.054,"text":"DNA barcodes."},{"start":13381.794,"end":13383.194,"text":"We think about"},{"start":13385.114,"end":13388.254,"text":"transforming the database to a"},{"start":13389.074,"end":13392.454,"text":"series of publications covering the whole diversity of the country."},{"start":13393.194,"end":13395.834,"text":"I'm jealous to Norwegians for them to"},{"start":13396.814,"end":13400.134,"text":"have this kind of publication. For Poland, it was not possible before."},{"start":13401.434,"end":13404.074,"text":"And the good idea would be, I"},{"start":13405.254,"end":13409.194,"text":"had something like this in my mind, to propose such"},{"start":13409.274,"end":13409.414,"text":"an"},{"start":13410.254,"end":13410.974,"text":"integrated"},{"start":13411.974,"end":13412.494,"text":"approach."},{"start":13414.314,"end":13417.254,"text":"Creating national checklists in Europe to"},{"start":13418.314,"end":13421.654,"text":"compare the biodiversity levels of different countries."},{"start":13421.714,"end":13424.214,"text":"It's possible, it's doable. It could be a good"},{"start":13426.894,"end":13428.674,"text":"idea for the nodes"},{"start":13429.634,"end":13430.634,"text":"for the cooperation."},{"start":13432.834,"end":13434.014,"text":"So thank you very much."},{"start":13440.634,"end":13444.594,"text":"Okay, we don't have any questions online at the moment, but do we have questions in"},{"start":13444.634,"end":13445.194,"text":"the room?"},{"start":13451.354,"end":13452.714,"text":"You've done such a good job, Piotr."}]